{"repositoryId":234906257,"availability":"available","full":"aravindvnair99/Spot-the-Hole","name":"Spot-the-Hole","description":"Fully autonomous and intelligent platform to detect, monitor and manage potholes issues. An end-to-end system with a PWA front-end for users to report potholes and government authorities to track and manage them.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":4,"created":"2020-01-19T13:37:56Z","updated":"2026-10-08T12:32:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://spot-the-hole.web.app","topics":["automl","busboy","cookie-parser","ejs","ejs-express","express","firebase","firebase-auth","firebase-authentication","firebase-firestore","firebase-functions","firebase-hosting","firebase-storage","gcp","hacktoberfest","potholes","pwa","vader","vader-sentiment-analysis","vadersentiment"],"demo":"https://spot-the-hole.web.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:18.947Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:18.947Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:18.947Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T21:35:18.947Z","stars":9,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Official source code of Spot the Hole PWA which was a project for Open Lab at Amrita School of Engineering, Bengaluru.","Potholes are the biggest problem faced by everyone today. Driving down these roads is a nightmare. Repaving the roads would be a big investment in many ways, not only would it improve the towns look, but it would also make it safer for the community members to drive on the roads. Now the problem lies in the fact that concerned departments are not able to coordinate to resolve the issue and citizens also find it hard to file a complaint.","Fundamentally there is a disconnection between civil agencies, people, and elected representatives. Our aim is to build a web-based dynamic reporting system which will facilitate the flow of information among all concerned stakeholders. It also provides better governance by more involvement of the public."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aravindvnair99/Spot-the-Hole/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d4f7ed81905125d855bf7914dcdf203906e3e2fc0626058c1d63018074eb4ded","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:19.060Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:19.060Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Official source code of Spot the Hole PWA which was a project for Open Lab at Amrita School of Engineering, Bengaluru.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aravindvnair99/Spot-the-Hole/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d4f7ed81905125d855bf7914dcdf203906e3e2fc0626058c1d63018074eb4ded","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aravindvnair99/Spot-the-Hole/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:19.060Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T12:32:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aravindvnair99/Spot-the-Hole/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:19.060Z","hash":"d4f7ed81905125d855bf7914dcdf203906e3e2fc0626058c1d63018074eb4ded","originalBytes":3873,"storedBytes":3873,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:35:18.947Z","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Browser extensions & PWAs","source":"metadata","match":"PWA"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automotive"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://spot-the-hole.web.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-16T21:47:04.939Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T21:47:04.939Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-16T21:47:04.939Z","target":"https://spot-the-hole.web.app/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-23T21:47:04.939Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:47:04.939Z","